<title>HONG KONG: Regent Pacific debuts at HK$2.80/share.</title>
<headline>Regent Pacific debuts at HK$2.80/share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Hong Kong-based global emerging markets investment house Regent Pacific Group Ltd made their trading debut at HK$2.80, compared with the issue price of HK$2.62.</p>
</text>
